00:31:55.600 --> 00:31:59.360
that all security protocols
have been. and are being. followed.

504
00:32:00.760 --> 00:32:05.560
OK. No bother. Like all teams.
you run a hot-desk policy?

505
00:32:05.600 --> 00:32:08.840
All your programmers can log
in on any computer?

506
00:32:08.880 --> 00:32:13.200
This applies to all machines.
sandboxes included?

507
00:32:13.240 --> 00:32:14.280
Yeah.

508
00:32:15.760 --> 00:32:17.480
What happens
if you need to leave your desk?

509
00:32:19.360 --> 00:32:20.600
Well. then you log out.

510
00:32:22.600 --> 00:32:25.920
We're. we're pretty hot on that.
Even for a quick pee?

511
00:32:25.960 --> 00:32:27.800
You leave a machine logged in.

512
00:32:27.840 --> 00:32:30.520
and someone comes along
and doesn't know...

513
00:32:31.840 --> 00:32:35.400
accidentally wipes all your work.
Or. you know.

514
00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:39.920
spills coffee. whatever. So if
someone. while they're logged in...

515
00:32:41.080 --> 00:32:42.360
accessed something...

516
00:32:44.200 --> 00:32:46.440
Like what? Anything.

517
00:32:46.480 --> 00:32:48.160
Something on the system.

518
00:32:48.200 --> 00:32:51.120
It would pretty much have
to be through their own log-in?

519
00:32:51.160 --> 00:32:53.960
Yes. I'd have thought so.
Can you be 100% sure?

520
00:32:55.320 --> 00:32:58.080
Well. no. but... 99%.

521
00:33:00.360 --> 00:33:01.400
Is this about the attack?

522
00:33:01.440 --> 00:33:02.920
Just answer the questions. please.

523
00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:22.040
Alex. Danny. We've got the sign-off

524
00:33:22.080 --> 00:33:24.560
from Marston on
the Vadim Trusov exfiltration.

525
00:33:24.600 --> 00:33:25.880
That's good.

526
00:33:25.920 --> 00:33:29.440
But. I'm afraid we've had word from
Dutch intel.

527
00:33:29.480 --> 00:33:32.920
They've had a sighting of Trusov.
They've got a hack on the camera on

528
00:33:32.960 --> 00:33:34.920
the FSB entrance in Saint Petersburg.

529
00:33:34.960 --> 00:33:39.840
It's not good news.
Needless to say. if they have him.

530
00:33:39.880 --> 00:33:45.160
we can't proceed. and I imagine
Vadim Trusov is in grave danger.

531
00:33:45.200 --> 00:33:47.480
Does that mean they know
we're inside their system?

532
00:33:47.520 --> 00:33:48.720
There's no indication as yet.

533
00:33:48.760 --> 00:33:53.720
But if the FSB have got him.
it can only be a matter of time.

534
00:33:53.760 --> 00:33:54.760
OK.

535
00:34:13.960 --> 00:34:16.000
Where are they? Where's who?

536
00:34:16.040 --> 00:34:19.320
The soldiers in the FSB system.
I mean. this is all us.

537
00:34:19.360 --> 00:34:22.320
What are they doing? They're soldiers.

538
00:34:22.360 --> 00:34:25.360
They follow orders.
They don't ask questions.

539
00:34:25.400 --> 00:34:27.080
Maybe you should try it sometime.

540
00:34:28.520 --> 00:34:30.200
Right after my next sarcasm lesson?

541
00:35:19.800 --> 00:35:21.200
Looking for something?

542
00:35:25.560 --> 00:35:27.360
They're rigging the FSB
system to blow it up.

543
00:35:27.400 --> 00:35:29.360
Excuse me. If we blow the system.

544
00:35:29.400 --> 00:35:31.720
they'll find out how we got in
and trace it back to Vadim.

545
00:35:31.760 --> 00:35:34.000
Saara. go back to your station. Shall we?

546
00:35:51.760 --> 00:35:52.880
Come in. Danny.

547
00:35:59.080 --> 00:36:00.640
Lieutenant Colonel Cavendish.

548
00:36:00.680 --> 00:36:03.000
I'm so sorry I wasn't
able to greet you earlier.

549
00:36:05.520 --> 00:36:07.160
Problem?

550
00:36:07.200 --> 00:36:09.120
I am the Director of Operations.

551
00:36:09.160 --> 00:36:12.160
I answer to the Foreign Secretary.
I cannot answer to him

552
00:36:12.200 --> 00:36:15.280
if there are operations being
conducted behind my back.

553
00:36:15.320 --> 00:36:17.216
My operation was ordered by
the Foreign Secretary.

554
00:36:17.240 --> 00:36:20.400
It has not been conducted
behind your back. but in parallel.

555
00:36:20.440 --> 00:36:21.480
Operation?

556
00:36:21.520 --> 00:36:25.880
To mine and blow up the FSB system.
and the Russians will retaliate.

557
00:36:25.920 --> 00:36:27.560
It will end in World War III.

558
00:36:27.600 --> 00:36:30.600
To install a comprehensive
array of degrading effects

559
00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:33.840
to trigger as and when we receive
orders from our superiors.

560
00:36:33.880 --> 00:36:37.840
We cannot have two chains of command
in the one operations room.

561
00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:39.280
We don't.

562
00:36:39.320 --> 00:36:43.080
We have two parallel operations.

563
00:36:43.120 --> 00:36:46.200
Our political masters will decide
which one they wish to pursue.

564
00:36:49.200 --> 00:36:51.080
In that case. I'll get back to
what I was doing.

565
00:36:52.560 --> 00:36:54.160
Danny. a moment.

566
00:37:00.080 --> 00:37:02.840
I don't like it either but we cannot
control the Government.

567
00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:04.440
We can only advise.

568
00:37:04.480 --> 00:37:07.400
After the last few weeks.
Marston's going to be all over us.

569
00:37:07.440 --> 00:37:09.280
You heard him.

570
00:37:09.320 --> 00:37:11.560
We need to be seen to be running
a steady ship.

571
00:37:15.440 --> 00:37:17.120
And we need to find that mole.

572
00:37:29.320 --> 00:37:32.280
Sally. can you get me Michaela Jones
at the NSA. please?

573
00:37:32.320 --> 00:37:33.320
Of course.

574
00:37:36.920 --> 00:37:38.376
You're gonna let her do it.
aren't you? Sorry.

575
00:37:38.400 --> 00:37:39.680
What about Vadim?

576
00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:41.720
It won't take them long
to work out how we got in.

577
00:37:41.760 --> 00:37:44.880
They're not going to blow it up.
Not if I can help it.

578
00:37:44.920 --> 00:37:47.760
But the news on Vadim is...

579
00:37:47.800 --> 00:37:49.840
It's not so good. I'm afraid.

580
00:37:49.880 --> 00:37:53.120
Hacked CCTV footage shows Vadim
and other coders being led out of

581
00:37:53.160 --> 00:37:55.160
the FSB headquarters in St Petersburg.

582
00:37:55.200 --> 00:37:57.440
When? Same night he leaked
us the material.

583
00:37:58.760 --> 00:37:59.760
That's days ago.

584
00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:09.560
He's only there because he helped us.

585
00:38:11.440 --> 00:38:13.120
What will they be doing to him?

586
00:38:13.160 --> 00:38:15.880
I don't know. Saara. I don't know.

587
00:38:15.920 --> 00:38:17.160
MI6 believe that as long

588
00:38:17.200 --> 00:38:19.216
as Vadim is in the hands
of the Russian authorities...

589
00:38:19.240 --> 00:38:21.920
They need to get him out.
..they won't be able to help him.

590
00:38:23.520 --> 00:38:24.520
I'm sorry. Saara.

591
00:38:27.160 --> 00:38:28.200
This is all my fault.

592
00:38:45.920 --> 00:38:48.400
That's Michaela for you.
Thank you. Sally.

593
00:38:48.440 --> 00:38:50.320
Michaela.Dan.

594
00:38:50.360 --> 00:38:52.280
We have a problem with
Richard Marston.

595
00:38:53.480 --> 00:38:55.080
He's been moved to Foreign. hasn't he?

596
00:38:55.120 --> 00:38:57.440
Yeah. He's playing nice.
as nice as he can.

597
00:38:57.480 --> 00:39:01.040
But he's determined to live out his
Churchillian fantasies.

598
00:39:01.080 --> 00:39:04.680
So he's sent in his own dirty tricks
team to blow up the FSB system.

599
00:39:04.720 --> 00:39:07.960
Shit. Greatest listening
opportunity we've ever had

600
00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:10.960
and he wants to piss it up the wall
for the sake of his own ego.

601
00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:13.000
How soon before his finger gets itchy?

602
00:39:13.040 --> 00:39:15.560
I don't know. but my guess is not long.

603
00:39:17.320 --> 00:39:19.000
I'll talk to Perez. Thank you.

604
00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:51.440
I'd like to work on the
offensive cyber with you.

605
00:39:51.480 --> 00:39:53.376
I don't want to imagine
what they're doing to Vadim.

606
00:39:53.400 --> 00:39:54.880
I just want to hurt them back.

607
00:39:56.160 --> 00:39:57.320
I'm good at this.

608
00:40:03.520 --> 00:40:04.840
Yeah. start on the comms code.

609
00:40:06.400 --> 00:40:07.880
Then... we'll see.

610
00:40:09.440 --> 00:40:10.640
I'll be watching.

611
00:40:46.760 --> 00:40:48.560
Come in.

612
00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:55.840
You're working with them now. are you?

613
00:40:55.880 --> 00:40:57.240
You told me to look

614
00:40:57.280 --> 00:41:00.560
for our missing Mac log-in data
in the FSB system.

615
00:41:00.600 --> 00:41:02.560
Otherwise she'd see me in there.

616
00:41:02.600 --> 00:41:04.120
I'm impressed.

617
00:41:04.160 --> 00:41:05.840
And?

618
00:41:05.880 --> 00:41:08.640
Nothing. Not even a trace.
And there's no sign

619
00:41:08.680 --> 00:41:11.280
of any data they stole
from us in their system.

620
00:41:11.320 --> 00:41:13.760
Sorry. Saara. I've got to take this.

621
00:41:17.120 --> 00:41:18.480
General Perez. sir.

622
00:41:20.560 --> 00:41:21.680
You have two minutes.

623
00:41:21.720 --> 00:41:23.480
I appreciate I'm speaking out of turn.

624
00:41:23.520 --> 00:41:26.360
but I felt you should
know our listening operation against

625
00:41:26.400 --> 00:41:29.520
the FSB is in danger.
and not from the Russians.

626
00:41:32.920 --> 00:41:34.360
Night. Dave. See you.

627
00:41:57.680 --> 00:41:58.680
Pub?

628
00:42:00.320 --> 00:42:02.520
Thanks. I don't really do pubs.

629
00:42:11.120 --> 00:42:13.480
So. what did old
Checkpoint Charlie want?

630
00:42:13.520 --> 00:42:15.240
Just routine. he said.

631
00:42:15.280 --> 00:42:17.760
But he was asking a lot of questions
about our sandboxes.

632
00:42:17.800 --> 00:42:20.720
Really? Phil? Changed your mind?

633
00:42:20.760 --> 00:42:23.520
Do you know a game called
End of Daze?

634
00:42:23.560 --> 00:42:28.680
Yeah. it's... Horizon Zero Dawn
with a touch of Zelda.

635
00:42:28.720 --> 00:42:31.240
Phil's Mr Gamer.
The rougher the dystopia.

636
00:42:31.280 --> 00:42:32.840
the more he enjoys it.

637
00:42:32.880 --> 00:42:35.120
I just need to know how to get into
the Discord chat.

638
00:42:36.480 --> 00:42:38.680
Well... You'll be sorry you asked.

639
00:42:40.600 --> 00:42:42.640
Let's see.

640
00:42:42.680 --> 00:42:46.240
Yeah. You need to switch those around.

641
00:42:46.280 --> 00:42:50.760
I swear. if one of
you ever goes behind my back to

642
00:42:50.800 --> 00:42:52.200
the Yanks like that again.

643
00:42:52.240 --> 00:42:54.840
I will see to it
that you're charged with treason.

644
00:42:57.880 --> 00:43:01.120
If I may. Foreign Secretary.
to function effectively

645
00:43:01.160 --> 00:43:04.520
as a government
intelligence gathering institution.

646
00:43:04.560 --> 00:43:07.480
there can be no going
behind anyone's back.

647
00:43:07.520 --> 00:43:10.040
I had hoped this could be a new
beginning.

648
00:43:10.080 --> 00:43:14.360
He means that we understand fully
and unequivocally.

649
00:43:16.960 --> 00:43:18.280
Just to be clear.

650
00:43:18.320 --> 00:43:21.800
we're not triggering the degrading
effects.

651
00:43:21.840 --> 00:43:25.160
That is correct. Lieutenant Colonel.
we are not triggering them...

652
00:43:27.000 --> 00:43:28.120
yet.

653
00:43:46.160 --> 00:43:48.120
How are the interviews going?

654
00:43:49.240 --> 00:43:50.360
Nothing jumping out.

655
00:43:52.000 --> 00:43:54.800
They're a pretty clean bunch.
your coders.

656
00:43:54.840 --> 00:43:57.280
They just busted their guts
turning this thing around.

657
00:43:58.440 --> 00:44:00.040
For one of them to be the cause of it...

658
00:44:01.720 --> 00:44:03.320
Man. that'd just break my heart.

659
00:44:04.720 --> 00:44:05.720
I pity them.

660
00:44:07.640 --> 00:44:09.360
Nobody wakes up in the morning
and says.

661
00:44:09.400 --> 00:44:11.040
"Today I'm going to betray"

662
00:44:11.080 --> 00:44:14.680
"my colleagues.
my friends. my family. my country."

663
00:44:16.080 --> 00:44:18.040
Sometimes they're believers.

664
00:44:18.080 --> 00:44:19.640
but usually they've been got to.

665
00:44:21.680 --> 00:44:24.320
Love. sex. blackmail.

666
00:44:26.000 --> 00:44:29.080
By the time we get to them. they're
in the worst place in the world.

667
00:44:30.680 --> 00:44:32.960
But don't worry. Dan. We'll find the mole.

668
00:44:35.280 --> 00:44:36.520
Clock's ticking.

669
00:46:49.760 --> 00:46:50.960
What are you doing?

670
00:47:34.040 --> 00:47:37.000
Subtitles by Red Bee Media
